  _landmarkId: oludeniz
  _displayTitle: "\xD6l\xFCdeniz"
  _shortDescription: "\xD6l\xFCdeniz, turkuaz lag\xFCn\xFC ve Kumburnu\u2019nun olu\u015Fturdu\u011Fu
    benzersiz k\u0131y\u0131 \u015Fekliyle T\xFCrkiye\u2019nin en tan\u0131nan do\u011Fal
    manzaralar\u0131ndan biridir. Sakin lag\xFCn ile a\xE7\u0131k denizin yan yana
    olu\u015Fturdu\u011Fu renk ge\xE7i\u015Fi, b\xF6lgenin ikonik g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFCn\xFC
    yarat\u0131r. Babada\u011F\u2019dan yap\u0131lan yama\xE7 para\u015F\xFCtleri
    de bu manzaray\u0131 d\xFCnyaca \xFCnl\xFC h\xE2le getirmi\u015Ftir."
  _sector: "Fethiye / T\xDCRK\u0130YE"
